{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026GncnCRtBEK1795412859.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西九龍南昌分行高級分行經理李子清表示，分行最新促成一宗南昌站維港匯II租賃成交，單位為2座低層C室，實用面積807平方呎，採三房套房及工人套房間隔，單位座向南方，擁開揚海景，最新以50000元租出，折合實用呎租62元。</p><p><br/>中原地產李子清指，上址業主於2026年8月以2108萬元買入單位，持貨短短3個月，是次租出單位可享2.8厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.278283+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T13:37:14.230046+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:15.307976+00:00","content_hash":"1b3585f7ef55fba33ad19a254d948bc1279f6e6640ce42abb4f0bd7c40d5853e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.278283+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}